                <p>For Rusk’s memorandum of his May 19 conversation with Hoyer Millar, see <ref
                        target="#pg324">p. 324</ref>; the Department paper under reference here was
                    included as Annex B thereto, <ref target="#pg326">p. 326</ref>.</p>
            </note>
